          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose amaze kwandika amagambo y'ayo mategeko mu gitabo, ayarangije ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ategeka Abalewi baremērwa isanduku y'isezerano ry'Uwiteka ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimwende iki gitabo cy'amategeko, mugishyire iruhande rw'isanduku y'isezerano ry'Uwiteka Imana yanyu, kibereyo kuba umuhamya ubashinja ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko nzi ubugome bwanyu n'uko mutagonda amajosi. Ubwo mugomera Uwiteka nkiriho, nkiri kumwe namwe muri iki gihe, ntimuzarushaho nimara gupfa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munteranirize abakuru b'imiryango yanyu bose n'abatware banyu, kugira ngo mvugire aya magambo mu matwi yabo, ntange ijuru n'isi ho abahamya bazabashinja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko nzi yuko nimara gupfa muziyonona rwose, mugateshuka mukava mu nzira nabategetse. Kandi ibyago bizababaho mu gihe cya nyuma, kuko muzakora icyo Uwiteka abona ko ari kibi, ngo mumurakarishe ibiremwa n'intoki zanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
